@startuml Database Relationships

title Database Relationships - BidNow System

' Core Entity Relationships
Item has Category (many-to-one)
Item has User as Seller (many-to-one)
Item has Auctions (one-to-many)

Category has Items (one-to-many)

Auction has Item (many-to-one)
Auction has User as Seller (many-to-one)
Auction has User as Winner (many-to-one, nullable)
Auction has Bids (one-to-many)
Auction has AutoBids (one-to-many)
Auction has Messages (one-to-many)
Auction has Ratings (one-to-many)
Auction has Watchlists (one-to-many)

' User Relationships
User has Items (one-to-many)
User has Auctions as Seller (one-to-many)
User has Auctions as Winner (one-to-many)
User has Bids (one-to-many)
User has AutoBids (one-to-many)
User has Messages as Sender (one-to-many)
User has Messages as Receiver (one-to-many)
User has Notifications (one-to-many)
User has Ratings as Rater (one-to-many)
User has Ratings as Rated (one-to-many)
User has UserRoles (one-to-many)
User has Watchlists (one-to-many)
User has FavoriteSellers as Buyer (one-to-many)
User has FavoriteSellers as Seller (one-to-many)
User has ContactMessages (one-to-many)
User has SearchKeywords (one-to-many)
User has Orders as Buyer (one-to-many)
User has Orders as Seller (one-to-many)
User has Disputes as Buyer (one-to-many)
User has Disputes as Seller (one-to-many)
User has Disputes as Resolver (one-to-many)
User has EmailVerifications (one-to-many)

' Bid Relationships
Bid has Auction (many-to-one)
Bid has User as Bidder (many-to-one)

AutoBid has Auction (many-to-one)
AutoBid has User (many-to-one)

' Message Relationships
Message has User as Sender (many-to-one)
Message has User as Receiver (many-to-one)
Message has Auction (many-to-one, nullable)

' Rating Relationships
Rating has Auction (many-to-one)
Rating has User as Rater (many-to-one)
Rating has User as Rated (many-to-one)

' Watchlist Relationships
Watchlist has User (many-to-one)
Watchlist has Auction (many-to-one)

' FavoriteSeller Relationships
FavoriteSeller has User as Buyer (many-to-one)
FavoriteSeller has User as Seller (many-to-one)

' Order Relationships
Order has Auction (many-to-one)
Order has User as Buyer (many-to-one)
Order has User as Seller (many-to-one)
Order has Payment (one-to-one)
Order has Dispute (one-to-one, nullable)

' Payment Relationships
Payment has Order (many-to-one, one-to-one)

' Dispute Relationships
Dispute has Order (many-to-one, one-to-one)
Dispute has User as Buyer (many-to-one)
Dispute has User as Seller (many-to-one)
Dispute has User as Resolver (many-to-one, nullable)

' Other Relationships
ContactMessage has User (many-to-one, nullable)
SearchKeyword has User (many-to-one)
EmailVerification has User (many-to-one)
UserAuctionView has User (many-to-one)
UserAuctionView has Auction (many-to-one)

@enduml

